snippet.textDisplay:
@foxbusinessclips China is treating embodied AI like a spectator sport. Humanoid games, robot boxing, martial arts. The show is the cover. The real product is a live testbed.

They put chassis in the wild, release open-weight models, and let enthusiasts run the evals. Every bout is teleop data, failure cases, and hardware feedback. Tickets fund the loop. The lab gets a data flywheel for the next model and the next frame.

That is how you co-develop software and hardware in public.

