@drewhjc You have a fundamental misunderstanding of the geopolitical situation. In America and EU there are two theories about how to deal with Nations that have fundamentally different political structure. 

One group thinks Trade and open cooperation eventually creates trust and will also prove the efficacy of Capitalism/Democracy and Liberty. They believe that differing philosophies can live in peaceful coexistence and are willing to do almost anything including shared technology and reduced defensive posture to achieve this end state. 

The other group is self preservationist. They feel that we need to be self reliant and very suspicious of any system that is so fundamentally different. This group believes the natural progression of power and human nature has ALWAYS historically favored survival of the fittest at the expense of the weak.

